.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-decrypt 1  "oct-decrypt " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-decrypt \- Decrypt data using a card
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct decrypt\fR <\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR> [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-user\-pin\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIinput\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Decrypt data using a card
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-user\-pin\fR \fI<User PIN file>\fR
Optionally, get User PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<output>\fR
Output file (stdout if unset)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIinput\fR]
Input file (stdin if unset)
